*.tgz
!chart/charts/**/charts/*.tgz
.DS_Store
/tmp/
*.log
kubeconfig
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# helm-toolkit is vendored ONCE at charts/helm-toolkit and pulled into each chart by
# `helm dependency build`. Before this it was committed 34 times, byte-identical, while
# every Chart.yaml declared a path (file://../helm-toolkit) that did not exist on a clean
# clone -- so `helm dependency build` failed and only the committed copies made rendering work.
blueprints/*/chart/charts/
blueprints/*/chart/Chart.lock
